    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "- Starting from €735,000.\r\n- Spacious 5-bedroom detached dormer residence extending to approximately 242 sq.m. / 2,604 sq.ft.\r\n- Located within the exclusive Cluain Aoibhinn development in Calverstown, Co. Kildare.\r\n- A-rated energy-efficient home.\r\n- Generous open-plan kitchen, dining and family living spaces.\r\n- Bespoke fitted kitchen by Castleteel Kitchens.\r\n- Utility room and excellent storage throughout.\r\n- Contemporary bathrooms and en-suite finishes.\r\n- High-quality fitted wardrobes included.\r\n- Private garden and ample parking.\r\n -Covered by a 10-Year Structural Guarantee.\r\n\r\nBlackhall Type G is an exceptional 5-bedroom detached dormer home extending to approximately 242 sq.m. (2,604 sq.ft.), offering generous accommodation and a thoughtfully designed layout ideally suited to modern family living. Located within the exclusive Cluain Aoibhinn development in Calverstown, this impressive residence combines contemporary design, energy efficiency and premium finishes throughout.\r\n\r\nDesigned to maximise space and natural light, the Blackhall offers expansive living accommodation with large open-plan kitchen, dining and family areas, complemented by beautifully proportioned reception rooms and spacious bedrooms. The layout provides the perfect balance between everyday family life and entertaining.\r\n\r\nFinished to an exceptional standard, the home includes a bespoke fitted kitchen by Castleteel Kitchens, quality fitted wardrobes, stylish bathrooms and en-suites, and an A energy rating.\r\n\r\nSet within the welcoming village of Calverstown, residents can enjoy a peaceful countryside setting while benefiting from excellent access to Kilcullen, Naas, Newbridge and the M7 motorway, making commuting to Dublin straightforward and convenient.\r\n\r\nBlackhall Type G presents a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial new detached family home in an exclusive Kildare development where quality, comfort and convenience come together beautifully."
      },
